system was messed up,

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:02.010
so they recalibrated the
radar, but the signal remained.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.450
Something was up here.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.280
- They're telling us they
have a contact on their radar.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.660
They don't know what it
is. They just have a blip.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:07.920
Well, they've been watching these things,

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.020
