freaking report about the update,

00:25:26.250 --> 00:25:31.140
the 2022 Annual Report on
Unidentified Aerial Phenomena,

00:25:31.140 --> 00:25:31.973
UAP, baby.

00:25:31.973 --> 00:25:34.290
We've gone through this,
and the update is that

00:25:34.290 --> 00:25:36.150
